# Phase 05 — Plans & subscriptions

## Goal

Plan CRUD and member subscriptions with calendar-month expiry in the gym timezone, renewals, and edge-case unit tests.

## Tasks

- Plan CRUD: monthly, quarterly, half-yearly, annual; price in paise (`bigint`).
- Assign plan to member; expiry via calendar-month arithmetic in the gym timezone (default `Asia/Kolkata`).
- Renewal flow; expiring / expired indicators; subscription history.
- Unit tests for month-end, leap-year, and early/late renewal.

## Done when

- [ ] Plan CRUD works with paise prices
- [ ] Assign, expiry, and renewal behave correctly in gym timezone
- [ ] Expiring / expired indicators and history work
- [ ] Unit tests cover month-end, leap-year, early/late renewal
- [ ] Lint, typecheck, and tests pass

Update BUILD_STATUS.md, then stop and wait for me.
